Read the setup and derive the answer. What value does this procedure return?
int[] a = {5, 4, 9, -2, -1, -2, 2, 2};
int acc = a[0];
for (int i = 1; i < a.length; i++) if (a[i] > acc) acc = a[i];
return acc;

